omer, operates a supernova web page at www.rochesterastronomy.org/supernova.html, which lists new discoveries, including images.","ref":"2007 March, Doug Rich, “How to Search for Supernovae”, in Astronomy, volume 35, number 3, pages 70–72:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[57,65]],"id":"5ddbc850-b891-4f54-a05f-6e9a0640a15c"}],"wikidata":["Q36774"],"senseid":["en:Q36774"],"categories":["English terms with quotations","en:Internet"],"links":[["Internet","Internet"],["hypertext","hypertext"],["HTML","HTML"],["World Wide Web","World Wide Web"],["hyperlink","hyperlink"],["web browser","web browser"]],"raw_glosses":["(Internet) A single hypertext document (transmitted as HTML) on the World Wide Web, often hyperlinked to others, and intended to be viewed with a web browser."],"glosses":["A single hypertext document (transmitted as HTML) on the World Wide Web, often hyperlinked to others, and intended to be viewed with a web browser."],"tags":["Internet"],"id":"23e3f990-832e-458a-bb75-10068478bb0e"},{"examples":[{"text":"Be sure to check out my web page on the Internet when you get home.","bold_text_offsets":[[24,32]],"type":"example","id":"2903e53d-e147-4a74-9639-7ffcf5a43b2b"}],"links":[["website","website"],["home page","home page"]],"raw_glosses":["(loosely) A website, by extension from the home page of the site."],"glosses":["A website, by extension from the home page of the site."],"categories":["English terms with usage examples"],"tags":["broadly"],"id":"7f1d215b-bd1b-4316-86fd-712caf499f96"}],"related":[{"word":"HTML"},{"word":"PageRank"},{"word":"XHTML"}],"synonyms":[{"tags":["dated"],"word":"WWW page"}]},"webography":{"id":"caf5cd24-7800-4151-9d36-378743f6d772","word":"webography","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"a similar listing of websites","tags":["feminine"],"word":"webgrafia"}],"pos":"noun","tags":null,"senses":[{"links":[["bibliography","bibliography"],["World Wide Web","World Wide Web"]],"glosses":["A bibliography published on the World Wide Web."],"id":"c9edccdf-4b1e-4899-8c9a-e49937f20ab9"},{"links":[["listing","listing"],["website","website"]],"glosses":["A similar listing of websites."],"id":"c9a1b776-d2ca-42ed-9a64-fe8f1fca8a90"}],"related":[],"synonyms":[]},"webinar":{"id":"a24e270a-92d5-4e3d-aff0-237103da2c6a","word":"webinar","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"interactive seminar conducted via Internet","tags":["masculine"],"word":"webinário"}],"pos":"noun","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"I just got an email invitation to a webinar on the value of primary sources.","bold_text_offsets":[[36,43]],"type":"example","id":"bbf332f8-337f-42c6-9ebb-8ac1e36e2d5d"},{"text":"Web conferences or Webinars are a great way to learn about products or subjects of interest.","ref":"2002, Ann Rockley, Managing Enterprise Content, page 274:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[19,27]],"id":"b673d947-8fc1-49f1-abed-7bc4b6ff8888"},{"text":"Webinars are often painfully short on exposure to the actual product, devoting half of the typical one-hour length to an “expert” disserting on some lofty topic, another fifteen minutes to a fluffy presentation about the company and its strategic direction, and a scant five minutes to a quick demo.","ref":"2003, Francoise Tourniaire, Just Enough CRM, page 168:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[0,8]],"id":"d566d158-1181-403e-a085-f4cf1d93ff28"},{"text":"It's not that all women aren't interested in learning to download files or take Webinars, it's that their “why bother” factor may well kick in.","ref":"2003, Andrea Learned, quoted in Martha Barletta's Marketing to Women, page 93:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[80,88]],"id":"c2197069-d720-42da-9a55-02c6ba6dfaee"},{"text":"Register today for our informative webinar and executive book offer.","ref":"2006, Selling Power, volume 26, numbers 1–9, page 44:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[35,42]],"id":"5743b7aa-f4c1-4d39-bca1-d572a3834bcb"},{"text":"One other point: An impressive site design can never rescue poorly written copy, sloppy videos, or boring webinar recordings.","ref":"2011, Jon Wuebben, Content is Currency: Developing Powerful Content for Web and Mobile, page 28:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[106,113]],"id":"a8262082-5416-4b45-9f2c-7cf209081c33"},{"text":"Although there are many other tools that are available in a webinar tool, these are the ones you'll find yourself using most often.","ref":"2013, Kristin Kipp, Teaching on the Education Frontier, page 82:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[60,67]],"id":"fcdb219d-0b8d-4e43-b67d-363fb53b8c68"},{"text":"In response to this decline, a panel of Harvard scholars convened last week for a webinar to discuss how civil society groups can protect and promote democracy in such times of crisis.","ref":"2025 February 27, Gina Goldenberg, “From Crisis to Action: Turning the Tide on Democratic Erosion Through Organizing”, in Harvard Kennedy School, archived from the original on 29 Mar 2025:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[82,89]],"id":"67496b42-7505-461d-b093-37b9b9c6df10"}],"senseid":["en:interactive seminar conducted via Internet"],"links":[["seminar","seminar"],["Internet","Internet"]],"categories":["English blends","English countable nouns","English entries with incorrect language header","English lemmas","English nouns","English terms with quotations","English terms with usage examples","Entries with translation boxes","Pages with 5 entries","Pages with entries","Terms with Czech translations","Terms with Dutch translations","Terms with Esperanto translations","Terms with Finnish translations","Terms with French translations","Terms with German translations","Terms with Greek translations","Terms with Hebrew translations","Terms with Hungarian translations","Terms with Italian translations","Terms with Japanese translations","Terms with Latvian translations","Terms with Mandarin translations","Terms with Occitan t